# TaskWitness environment placeholders
#
# Phase 0–2: no model configuration required for deterministic TaskSpec
# replay and Playwright workflow demos.

# Phase 3+ live natural-language interpretation (OpenAI-compatible).
# Required only for: python -m taskwitness.interpret_goal
# Not required for: pytest, browser_demo with explicit WorkflowConfig/TaskSpec JSON.
#
# LLM_BASE_URL — optional. When empty, the openai client uses its default
#                OpenAI API base URL. Set this for compatible proxies/providers.
# LLM_API_KEY  — required for live interpretation. Never commit a real value.
# LLM_MODEL    — required for live interpretation (provider model id).
LLM_BASE_URL=
LLM_API_KEY=
LLM_MODEL=
